OL,5,G0200 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FIn a custom-built mobile surgery,
OL,7,     FGPs have a busy week helping
OL,8,     Fpatients including a boy with an
OL,9,     Finverted chest, a woman with a
OL,10,     Fmysterious rash, and an injury
OL,11,     Fcaused by a horse.
OL,12,G0250 Tom Read Wilson's Grand Tour
OL,13,     FTom enjoys Lake Como's serenity,
OL,14,     Frides a vintage water taxi to
OL,15,     FVilla Balbianello, learns about
OL,16,     FBritish royal scandals, and takes
OL,17,     Fa hot air balloon to Venice to
OL,18,     Fjoin the carnival.
